#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0127A expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "The data would fire on a BDS dataset - BASE is declared and ABLFL is not - but structure=ADSL is the DECLARED tier and beats the columns (Fix #154), so the dataset's structure is SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET, which is not in Scope.Data_Structures (BDS / MEDICAL DEVICE BDS): out of scope, never runs. The mandatory #library line is the carrier for the declaration."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AGE     type=Num
col BASE    type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 63 | 1.5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | 47 | 7.0
